      "review_summary": "The branch threads provider request proxy dispatcher policy through memory embedding HTTP and batch paths, with forwarding tests.\n\nPR surface: Source +54, Tests +144. Total +198 across 19 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. at source level: current main resolves memory embedding baseUrl, headers, and ssrfPolicy without dispatcherPolicy, while the PR body includes before/after live memory_search evidence from a restricted network.",
